<title>HONG KONG: Founder 1996 net profit up 16 percent.</title>
<headline>Founder 1996 net profit up 16 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   25.0     vs 35.0 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)     9.0     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	   nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net				126.80 vs   109.27</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,483.35 vs 1,096.23</p>
<p>    Company name		 Founder (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 23-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Founder (Hong Kong) is a computer software maker and distributor, listed on the stock exchange on December 21, 1995. It gave no details on the calcuation of the share earnings.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one-for-five shares held.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nine H.K. cents vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
